<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to survey, inspection or other conditions.</p>
<p>BULKERS.</p>
<p>Oakby - (built 1983) 64,197 dwt sold for $12.45 million.</p>
<p>Nea Tyhi - (built 1978) 28,648 dwt sold within Greece for $5.5 million.</p>
<p>Port Star - (built 1990) 27,881 dwt sold for $12.7 million.</p>
<p>Cynthia Winner - (built 1994) 23,732 dwt and sistership Cynthia Hope (built 1995) 23,720 dwt sold enbloc for $30.5 million.</p>
</text>
